{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Archon Soul is a 2D roguelike dice-builder where you create powerful dice using swappable faces, runes, and bodies with unique effects. \u200bDraft spells, craft powerful synergies, defeat challenging enemies, and conquer the Archon's palace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799470/extras/278d335e162b879bb5ec71b2f6b890cc.webp?t=1768426979\" width=616 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799470/extras/0d297a2ee562a27d533a6b68afbab154.poster.avif?t=1768426979\" width=616 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799470/extras/0d297a2ee562a27d533a6b68afbab154.webm?t=1768426979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>In the Prologue:</i>\u00a0</strong> 15 dice bodies (plus event only dice bodies) and 25 runes available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>In the full game:</i></strong>\u00a0In addition to changing the face values of your dice, you can also modify them with Dice Bodies and Runes. With 40 runes and over 30 dice bodies, each dice has <strong>more than 65,000 combinations</strong> to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799470/extras/d7f103404f1c22a6a77820b34bb90075.webp?t=1768426979\" width=616 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799470/extras/693eb78594913a84d333ac04ed6cf297.poster.avif?t=1768426979\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799470/extras/693eb78594913a84d333ac04ed6cf297.webm?t=1768426979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799470/extras/693eb78594913a84d333ac04ed6cf297.mp4?t=1768426979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>In the Prologue:</i></strong> Play as the Gaiamancer, with over 50 spells available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>In the full game</i></strong>: Play as the Gaiamancer, the Pyromancer, or the Thaumancer (or even a secret fourth character). Each mage has their own unique spells to choose from, over 200 spells in total! But spells alone won't be enough to get you through the palace to find the Archon Soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799470/extras/3158255e7c3c3e6f4967b744e5de3683.webp?t=1768426979\" width=616 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799470/extras/f00f6befe91aa94de505428bec36078e.poster.avif?t=1768426979\" width=616 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799470/extras/f00f6befe91aa94de505428bec36078e.webm?t=1768426979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799470/extras/f00f6befe91aa94de505428bec36078e.mp4?t=1768426979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft powerful combos between your spells, runes, and bodies to survive and thrive through brutal combats.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799470/extras/54a47e5b8965aa18a29f0329fc9ae5a6.webp?t=1768426979\" width=616 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the Archon's palace, choose your path, engage in combat, encounter events, defeat powerful bosses, and fight your way through 4 acts to make your way to the Archon Soul. Can you prove your worth to the Soul, and become one with its power?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill testing and strategic roguelike gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 playable characters to choose from\u00a0<strong><i>(in the full game)</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 200 spells\u00a0<strong><i>(in the full game)</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40 dice runes and over 30 dice bodies\u00a0<strong><i>(in the full game)</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of unique enemies to challenge your play style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful illustrated artwork by Anais Lehoux and Natalya Samutina</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soundtrack by Ofelia Argiro</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3799470?t=1768426979","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799470/87e09cbd6a011a92d722e8f77f084a4215783979/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768426979","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799470/85257d0b5bbe84fff5cf66a818535af3f4c777ae/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768426979","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799470/85257d0b5bbe84fff5cf66a818535af3f4c777ae/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768426979","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size"